{"id":"b2a4804023516b8f","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-reach-nl-complete.md","title":"REACH NL完全","display":"thm-reach-nl-complete — REACH NL完全","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-reach-nl-complete","aliases":["29-thm-reach-nl-complete"],"display":"thm-reach-nl-complete — REACH NL完全","depends_on":["[[29-df-standard-inputs]]","[[29-df-first-order-reduction]]","[[29-df-reach]]","[[29-df-many-one-reduction]]","[[29-df-completeness]]","[[29-df-complexity-classes]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem3.16, pp.51–52, scans66–67"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-reach-nl-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-reach-nl-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-reach-nl-complete — REACH NL完全"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4563061cac782dab\" href=\"?note=4563061cac782dab\" title=\"29-df-standard-inputs\">29-df-standard-inputs</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65b448b4269ca18e\" href=\"?note=65b448b4269ca18e\" title=\"29-df-first-order-reduction\">29-df-first-order-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9403bcdfde263660\" href=\"?note=9403bcdfde263660\" title=\"29-df-reach\">29-df-reach</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2005f7c77a4cbc08\" href=\"?note=2005f7c77a4cbc08\" title=\"29-df-many-one-reduction\">29-df-many-one-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5da52cc2e80d709c\" href=\"?note=5da52cc2e80d709c\" title=\"29-df-completeness\">29-df-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem3.16, pp.51–52, scans66–67"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NL}_{\\mathrm{std}}\">\\(\\mathrm{NL}_{\\mathrm{std}}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4563061cac782dab\" href=\"?note=4563061cac782dab\" title=\"29-df-standard-inputs\">29-df-standard-inputs</a>，词汇包含标准数值关系且域至少两个元素。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo,std}}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo,std}}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"65b448b4269ca18e\" href=\"?note=65b448b4269ca18e\" title=\"29-df-first-order-reduction\">29-df-first-order-reduction</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Complete}\">\\(\\operatorname{Complete}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5da52cc2e80d709c\" href=\"?note=5da52cc2e80d709c\" title=\"29-df-completeness\">29-df-completeness</a>；目标查询为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REACH}^{\\mathrm{std}}\">\\(\\mathrm{REACH}^{\\mathrm{std}}\\)</span>，由对应问题定义的显式结构版本给出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Complete}(\\mathrm{REACH}^{\\mathrm{std}},\\mathrm{NL}_{\\mathrm{std}},\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo,std}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Complete}(\\mathrm{REACH}^{\\mathrm{std}},\\mathrm{NL}_{\\mathrm{std}},\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo,std}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem3.16, pp.51–52, scans66–67。本条恢复原书Provisos1.14–1.15的输入范围，不对任意无序非空结构宣称同一弱归约完全性。原书构造对数空间机器的配置图；公式细节由Exercise3.20补足，本次未独立完成全部编码细节。</p>\n","headi